Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达发布专为智能代理打造的Vera芯片，OpenAI与SpaceX成为首批采用者</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">稀宇科技发布国产大模型MiniMax M3，支持1M上下文及原生多模态能力</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式重启机器人业务并公开招募工程师，聚焦具身智能基础设施研发</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">财务数据大危机！ChatGPT表格插件爆发严重安全漏洞</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/47e8ee7ca2f22eedd7c68f6f1011562e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">ChatGPT表格插件爆发严重安全漏洞AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 1, 202624在AI办公日益普及的今天，许多职场人士习惯使用智能插件来处理复杂的表格数据。然而，安全研究公司PromptArmor近日发布的一份报告，为整个行业敲响了警钟。报告披露，一款名为“ChatGPT for Google Sheets”的知名浏览器扩展程序存在严重的网络安全漏洞。恶意指令跨账户定向收割数据 这一漏洞的核心在于“间接提示词注入（Indirect Prompt Injection）”攻击。当用户日常导入一份看似正常、实则隐藏了恶意指令的外部数据集时，AI插件就会在未经授权的情况下被暗中触发。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布全球首款全开源全模态物理AI大模型Cosmos3并成立宇宙联盟</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cadef0b6e339073979f8973780097289.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月1日，英伟达正式发布全球首款全开源、全模态物理AI基础大模型Cosmos3。该模型采用混合Transformer架构，融合视觉推理、世界生成与动作预测能力，旨在解决具身智能在真实场景中泛化难的痛点。Cosmos3基于数十亿条跨模态物理数据训练，在Artificial Analysis等基准测试中位居开源模型榜首。英伟达同步推出Cosmos3Super（高精度）与Cosmos3Nano（快速推理）版本，Cosmos3Edge版本也在规划中。该模型通过深度解析物体交互规律与时空关联，显著缩短物理AI训练周期。此外，英伟达联合Agile Robots、Black Forest Labs、Runway等行业巨头成立“英伟达宇宙联盟”（NVIDIA Cosmos Coalition），旨在推动下一代智能体系统在现实世</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布专为智能代理打造的Vera芯片，OpenAI与SpaceX成为首批采用者</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/fa7d464ff0bb21f829b46e0fa3f51c2f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月1日，英伟达正式发布全新中央处理器（CPU）Vera，旨在为智能代理（AI Agent）提供底层算力支撑。该芯片专为处理CPU密集型工作负载设计，涵盖代理型AI任务、强化学习、高吞吐量数据处理及任务编排等场景。官方实测数据显示，Vera在处理代理型任务的执行速度上，较传统x86架构CPU提升了80%。目前，OpenAI、Anthropic及SpaceX已成为该芯片的首批企业级采用者，将加速其在AI研发与极端工业应用中的落地。业内分析认为，Vera的推出补齐了英伟达全栈AI基础设施的关键拼图，有望推动行业从传统x86架构向AI原生架构的算力迁移，对提升自主智能体在复杂场景下的响应与调度效率具有重要意义。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">稀宇科技发布国产大模型MiniMax M3，支持1M上下文及原生多模态能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/deab1083f052c25616dcd055581d9a29.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">稀宇科技正式发布新一代大模型MiniMax M3，该模型支持1M超长上下文，并具备图片、视频输入及电脑桌面操作的原生多模态能力，是国内首个集齐上述三项核心能力的开源模型。在SWE-Bench Pro编程评测中，M3以59.0%的得分超越GPT-5.5和Gemini 3.1 Pro，并在Claw-Eval及OmniDocBench测试中取得领先。技术层面，M3采用全新的稀疏注意力架构（MSA），在100万字上下文场景下，单token计算量降至上一代的一半，理解阶段提速超9倍，生成阶段提速超15倍。目前，MiniMax M3的API已正式开放，官方承诺在10天内向全球开发者开源模型权重与技术报告，此举将显著提升国产AI在复杂任务处理与多模态交互方面的行业竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式重启机器人业务并公开招募工程师，聚焦具身智能基础设施研发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d7c9b66cdadb43eb0acbfe4eba475f7c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI首席执行官Sam Altman于6月1日宣布重启机器人业务，并正式启动OpenAI Robotics团队招聘，广泛招募全栈硬件、运营、系统及机器学习工程师。此次布局标志着OpenAI将AGI能力从数字世界拓展至物理世界，重点攻克机器人在现实环境中的感知与操控难题。在战略规划上，OpenAI采取分阶段推进策略：短期聚焦研发协助技术工人建设基础设施的特定功能机器人，长期目标则是打造满足多样化需求的普适性个人机器人。作为行业风向标，OpenAI此举印证了多模态大模型与具身智能（Embodied AI）深度融合的趋势。随着大模型在逻辑推理与自然语言交互上的突破，软件生态的介入将加速智能机器人从工业制造向长尾物理应用场景的渗透，有望重塑当前由传统硬件厂商主导的市场格局，并推动全球基础设施建设及个人劳动力市场的</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
